## HTTPS / SSL
GitHub Pages provisions a free Let's Encrypt certificate automatically for `njcoast.me`.
Enable it: Repo Settings → Pages → check **Enforce HTTPS**.
The `CNAME` file (`njcoast.me`) must stay in the repo root — it is copied to `dist/` at build time by Vite.

